{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他暂时提不起劲争取，也没力气要求自己彻底改变，却说不清为何还舍不得丢开当初那一步和那份安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"提不起劲\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"src\": [\"S10-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道尽力去做确实帮过他，如今却也让他难以继续，若还争取就得记住当初为何不肯再等。\",\n      \"key\": \"尽力去做\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S10-2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道自己向往的生活确实曾让他安宁，可威胁它的事还在，珍惜这份安宁也不能把那些事放下。\",\n      \"key\": \"威胁它的事\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"src\": [\"S10-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他反复想着自己究竟想护住什么，想歇一歇也不等于要把那种生活丢下。\",\n      \"key\": \"歇一歇\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S10-4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他还不知道往后该怎么过，却不再急着判争取和安宁谁对谁错，也不再逼自己立刻选边。\",\n      \"key\": \"选边\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S10-5\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bc4654e2-6478-4358-ac43-5276da989b83", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T180049283793Z", "elapsed_seconds": 104.375, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T18:02:33.666146+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "96b2e5580364ce3bd23a403d0c035409a24e36f15694a2559c350e3ad8987e73", "attachment